UID:FzJTDHM_bowgDUK4k9BR_
SUMMARY:ENRG HTX - July 2026
DTSTAMP:20260717T140658Z
DTSTART:20260717T083000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/enrg-htx-july-2026-
	tickets-1992082402090?aff=oddtdtcreator \nENRG (Entrepreneurial Networking
	 Resource Group) is a community for entrepreneurs with 10-250 employees ru
	nning on EOS or EOS Curious. \n\n\n\nENRG (pronounced energy) is here to s
	tay in Houston! \nErick Garcia\, Lesa A Skipper and Craig Ceccanti are tea
	ming up to build the Houston ENRG Chapter and we could not be more excited
	 to invite entrepreneurs running on EOS or EOS Curious to this collaborati
	ve room! Join us on July 17th at 8:30am at the Ion District (Downstairs 02
	8) for the first meeting! \nWhat is ENRG?\nThe vision is to establish an E
	NRG (Entrepreneurial Networking Resource Group) in Houston for entrepreneu
	rs with 10-250 employees. This is a free EOS Worldwide aligned community f
	or entrepreneurs led by one EOS Implementer and one Integrator. \nEach mon
	thly meeting includes:\n– Practical training on an EOS tools\n– Peer-to-pe
	er issue solving\n– Valuable networking\n– Content that helps move the nee
	dle on your business\n– Exposure to Subject Matter Experts\nNo sales pitch
	es here though\, we’re here to help all tides rise! \nThis is WHERE entrep
	reneurs find the WHOs and the HOWs to move their business forward.\n\nhttp
	s://iondistrict.com/event/enrg-htx-june-2026/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/enrg-htx-june-2026/
LOCATION:Ion – Conference Room 028\, 4201 Main St.\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\,
	 United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
