SUMMARY:⭕️Cybersecurity Circle⭕️
DTSTAMP:20260717T140658Z
DTSTART:20260717T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Our mission is to DEFEAT CYBER CRIMINALS by making cybersecurit
	y knowledge accessible and relatable to everyone. This event creates a sup
	portive environment for individuals starting their cybersecurity journey\,
	 those transitioning into the field\, and professionals navigating job tra
	nsitions—including those rebuilding confidence after layoffs. Together\, w
	e strengthen our collective defense against cyber threats while fostering 
	career growth and community connections.\nThe ⭕️Cybersecurity Circle⭕️ unite
	s practitioners of all levels in an inclusive community committed to defea
	ting cybercrime through shared knowledge\, collaboration\, and continuous 
	learning. Together\, we’re securing our digital world—one hack at a time\n
	\nhttps://iondistrict.com/event/%e2%ad%95%ef%b8%8fcybersecurity-circle%e2%
	ad%95%ef%b8%8f-24/\n\nFrom Ion District
