DESCRIPTION:🎉 Join CCS and Omega Gaming for the Attack of the Vine! Pre-rel
	ease! Learn the new set\, or maybe Lorcana as a whole\, with fellow Illumi
	neers! \nThis event will cap at 24 players\, so sign up while supplies las
